It's short for perverts.

393
00:12:47,980 --> 00:12:50,340
你们整晚都在对他们投怀送抱
You guys were throwing yourselves at them all night long.

394
00:12:51,260 --> 00:12:53,020
我能怎么说 卖鞋子就是那样的
What can I say? That's shoe business.

395
00:12:54,780 --> 00:12:57,720
进家里可不能带枪
Whoa, no guns allowed in this house.

396
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,380
脱了上衣吧 丽莎
Let's off that top, Lisa.

397
00:12:59,380 --> 00:13:03,138
我是说 我给你加点酒吧 丽莎
Let's... let's top that off, Lisa.

398
00:13:03,138 --> 00:13:04,109
菲尔
Phil.

399
00:13:04,700 --> 00:13:05,760
这很有趣
So, this has been fun.

400
00:13:05,940 --> 00:13:08,020
