who knows if we'll get the house?

403
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:13,560
幸运的是
Fortunately,

404
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:15,940
你们找对了人[跟对的人上了床]
you are getting into bed with the right people.

405
00:13:16,020 --> 00:13:17,620
当然 我们不做不得体的事
Nothing inappropriate, of course.

406
00:13:17,980 --> 00:13:18,540
你懂的
Wink, wink.

407
00:13:18,740 --> 00:13:20,080
但不要误会了
But just so there's no misunderstanding,

408
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:20,960
我们想要你们
we want you.

409
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:26,600
你为什么不阻止我们
Why didn't you stop us?

410
00:13:26,610 --> 00:13:28,246
我又不知道你们想干什么
Hey, I don't know what you guys are into.

411
00:13:28,246 --> 00:13:29,736
天啊 我们要怎么做
Oh, my god. What are we gonna do?

412
00:13:29,736 --> 00:13:30,500
放轻松啦
Oh, relax.

413
00:13:30,500 --> 00:13:31,540
我敢肯定你们会找到
I'm sure you guys will find a couple

414
00:13:31,540 --> 00:13:32,480
