我来这里是因为她说你想道歉
I'm here because she says you want to apologize.

416
00:13:45,620 --> 00:13:47,460
是你该向我道歉
You're the one that owes the apology to me.

417
00:13:47,660 --> 00:13:48,420
是吗
Oh, yeah?

418
00:13:48,420 --> 00:13:50,220
1998年的橱柜大会
ClosetCon, 1998.

419
00:13:50,220 --> 00:13:51,560
你毁了我的摊位
You sabotaged my booth.

420
00:13:51,620 --> 00:13:53,720
那玩意儿倒了 因为它很廉价
That thing collapsed because it was cheap

421
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,740
而且是在东方买的 和你老婆一样
and bought in the orient -- like your wife.

422
00:13:56,020 --> 00:13:57,540
我说了多少次了
How many times do I have to tell people --

423
00:13:57,620 --> 00:13:58,780
见面是需要付钱
You only pay for the meeting.

424
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:00,340
