For all I know, you sent her over there to spy on me!

427
00:14:05,300 --> 00:14:06,820
索菲吗 她去你家干什么
Sophie? What is she doing at your house?

428
00:14:07,100 --> 00:14:07,720
跟我儿子约会
Dating my kid.

429
00:14:07,940 --> 00:14:09,900
米奇尔吗 他都有四十岁了
Mitchell? He's got to be 40 years old.

430
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:12,460
你不知道吗 我必须告诉你了
And don't you know that -- oh, I get to do this.

431
00:14:12,740 --> 00:14:13,820
米奇尔是基佬
Mitchell is gay.

432
00:14:14,020 --> 00:14:14,860
闭嘴
Shut up.

433
