My little, sweet Sophie?

436
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:23,760
没错
That's right.

437
00:14:24,660 --> 00:14:25,720
我儿子在跟她约会
My boy's dating her.

438
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:27,820
他在认真跟她约会
He's dating her real good.

439
00:14:27,820 --> 00:14:29,120
我要结束这一切
Well, I'm gonna put an end to it.

440
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:30,160
好主意 厄尔
Great idea, Earl.

441
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:31,640
因为女孩们就喜欢
'Cause girls love take advice

442
00:14:31,640 --> 00:14:33,340
从爷爷那听取关于男生的建议
