and we got you into...

452
00:14:56,040 --> 00:14:57,300
斯帕萝老师的班级
Miss Sparrow's class!

453
00:14:57,540 --> 00:14:58,760
-没搞错吧 -我还以为你是想让我说
- Really? - I thought you were setting me up.

454
00:14:59,260 --> 00:15:01,280
但我想留在普兰克老师的班里
But I want to stay with Mrs. Plank.

455
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:05,440
为什么啊 斯帕萝老师幽默又有创意
But why? Miss -- Miss Sparrow's so fun and creative.

456
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:06,820
今天 她给了我们纱线
Yeah, today, she gave us yarn,

457
00:15:06,940 --> 00:15:08,500
我们想做什么都行
and we did whatever we wanted.

458
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:10,260
我可不想玩纱线
I don't want to play with yarn.

459
00:15:10,460 --> 00:15:12,200
我想阅读 学数学
I want to read and learn math.

460
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:13,680
我们也学数学
We do math.

461
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:15,547
是吗 2加7等于几
Really? What's 2 plus 7?

462
00:15:16,685 --> 00:15:18,060
不 是9
No. No, it's 9.

463
00:15:18,060 --> 00:15:20,000
但那是无心之过 亲爱的
But that's an honest mistake, sweetheart.

464
00:15:20,180 --> 00:15:21,880
那蓝色和黄色混在一起是什么颜色
Okay, what does blue and yellow make?

465
00:15:22,026 --> 00:15:23,167
蓝黄色
Blellow.

466
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:26,520
你们得搞定这事
You need to fix this.

467
00:15:27,020 --> 00:15:29,040
我整晚都睡不着
I could not sleep all night

468
00:15:29,040 --> 00:15:30,720
想着那些讨厌的人们
