我 辣妹 开什么玩笑
Me? Hot? What?

473
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:42,620
菲尔 糟糕的邻居会毁掉你的一生
Phil, you know a bad neighbor can ruin your whole life.

474
00:15:42,620 --> 00:15:45,420
你记得我瑜伽课上认识的朋友朱丽叶吧
You remember my friend Juliet from yoga class?

475
00:15:45,420 --> 00:15:46,800
我们去过她哥哥的餐馆
We went to her brother's restaurant.

476
00:15:47,200 --> 00:15:48,000
戴成人牙套的
Adult braces.

477
00:15:48,260 --> 00:15:48,480
不记得
Nope.

478
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:49,520
黑色的
Black.

479
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:51,120
朱丽叶 她怎么样
Juliet. How is she?

480
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:52,200
惨透了
Miserable.

481
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:54,480
她家隔壁搬来了糟糕的邻居
These awful people moved in next door to her,

482
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:56,040
她感觉被困在了房子里
and she feels like she's trapped in her house.

483
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:57,900
她每天早上得跑到自己车上
She has to run to her car every morning.

484
00:15:57,900 --> 00:15:59,420
-怪不得她小腿肌肉发达 -菲尔
- That explains those calves. - Phil.

485
00:15:59,940 --> 00:16:00,940
那我应该怎么办
What am I supposed to do?

486
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,920
我这有一份报价 比要价高很多
I have one offer, and it's way above asking.

487
00:16:03,140 --> 00:16:03,940
我不知道
Well, I don't know.

488
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:05,400
也许 是否有可能
Maybe, isn't it possible

489
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:07,520
杰瑞根本就没看过这份报价
that Jerry never even sees this offer?

490
00:16:07,640 --> 00:16:10,080
东西有时候无缘无故就不见了
Things do go missing all the time.

491
00:16:10,100 --> 00:16:12,120
我在法律上有义务把所有报价都提供给他
I'm legally bound to present all offers.

492
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:14,160
-你懂的嘛 -不要再这样说了
- Wink, wink. - Stop doing that.

493
00:16:14,380 --> 00:16:15,880
隐瞒信息是违反地产经纪人的
Withholding information would be a violation

494
00:16:15,880 --> 00:16:16,800
入职宣誓的
of the realtor's oath.

495
00:16:16,940 --> 00:16:17,740
那宣誓是你自己写的
Which you wrote.

496
00:16:17,760 --> 00:16:19,440
我的结婚誓词也是自己写的
Well, I also wrote my own wedding vows.

497
00:16:19,460 --> 00:16:20,800
我干脆连那也一起违反吧
I guess I should break those, too?

498
00:16:21,340 --> 00:16:21,780
菲尔
Phil.

499
00:16:22,260 --> 00:16:23,100
看我胡说什么呢
What am I saying?

500
00:16:23,100 --> 00:16:25,100
每晚睡前我都会给你一个拥抱
I'll never send you to bed without a hug.

501
00:16:27,900 --> 00:16:28,420
曼尼起来了吗
Manny up yet?

502
