507
00:16:37,460 --> 00:16:39,000
疯狂的衣柜界的事了
about the crazy closet world.

508
00:16:39,060 --> 00:16:40,980
我为什么要唠叨"疯狂的衣柜界"呢
Why would I rant about crazy closet world?

509
00:16:41,100 --> 00:16:43,960
那家公司早就因为定价过高而没有销路了
Those lunatics priced themselves out of business years ago.

510
00:16:44,140 --> 00:16:44,580
曼尼
Manny?!

511
00:16:44,580 --> 00:16:46,708
两分钟就好 我在整理服装
Two minutes! I'm fixing my costume!

512
00:16:47,140 --> 00:16:49,040
他想不想跟那个女孩约会
If he wants to date this girl,

513
00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:50,460
都跟你没有关系
it's none of your business.

514
00:16:50,460 --> 00:16:53,099
这正是我要对他说的话
That's exactly what I was gonna tell him.

515
00:16:54,280 --> 00:16:54,940
杰在哪里
Where's Jay?

516
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,760
你来这干什么
What the hell are you doing here?

517
00:16:56,940 --> 00:16:59,220
我们之间的矛盾有些失控了
This thing between us is getting out of control.

518
00:16:59,420 --> 00:17:00,720
现在必须做个了结
We got to put an end to it right now.

519
00:17:00,720 --> 00:17:02,920
除非你愿意承担30年前你所做的事
As long as you own up to what you did 30 years ago.

520
00:17:03,160 --> 00:17:04,140
如果我道歉
If apologizing

521
00:17:04,140 --> 00:17:07,228
能让你那邪恶的儿子离我的索菲远点
is gonna keep your no-good son away from my Sophie, then --

522
00:17:07,228 --> 00:17:08,480
他才不是邪恶的
He's not a no-good!

523
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:10,460
没错 他是 他就是个行走的荷尔蒙
Yes, he is. He's a walking hormone.

524
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:12,540
现在听他道歉
Now, let's hear this apology.

525
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:13,840
好吧
Fine.

526
00:17:15,120 --> 00:17:18,120
那个时候我承受的压力很大 而且
I was under a lot of pressure back then, and -

527
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:20,960
好了 要记住我还没有化妆
Okay, keep in mind I'm not in makeup yet,

528
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:23,080
这凉鞋是不是让我的腿显得很粗
but do these sandals make my legs look thick?

529
00:17:23,163 --> 00:17:25,315
如果是的话 我可以把裙边卷下去
'Cause I -- I could lower the hem.

530
00:17:25,540 --> 00:17:26,380
天哪
Aw, geez.

531
00:17:26,380 --> 00:17:26,880
他是谁
Who's that?

532
00:17:26,880 --> 00:17:28,900
他是 是女佣的儿子
That's, uh, the maid's son.

533
00:17:28,900 --> 00:17:29,840
等会儿再说 戈麦斯
Not now, Gomez!

534
00:17:30,100 --> 00:17:31,120
杰 你在干什么
Jay, what are you doing?!

535
00:17:31,180 --> 00:17:32,260
让他把话说完
Letting the man speak!

536
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:34,400
真抱歉 我不知道有客人来了
I'm sorry, I didn't know we had any company.

537
00:17:34,780 --> 00:17:35,740
你好 我是曼尼
Hi. I'm Manny.

538
00:17:36,160 --> 00:17:36,880
你就是曼尼
You're Manny?

539
00:17:36,940 --> 00:17:38,400
你刚才说你当时压力很大...
You said you were under pressure...

540
00:17:38,540 --> 00:17:39,920
他就是那个对我的索菲
This is the big stud

541
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:41,660
毛手毛脚的大种马吗
who's been groping my Sophie?

542
00:17:42,500 --> 00:17:43,480
先生 我向您保证
Sir, I promise you

543
00:17:43,480 --> 00:17:45,320
我和索菲之间没什么见不得人的事
there's nothing untoward between me and Sophie.

544
00:17:47,206 --> 00:17:48,850
你知道吗 孩子
You know what, kid?

545
00:17:49,600 --> 00:17:50,500
我相信你
I believe you.

546
00:17:50,620 --> 00:17:51,460
你应该相信
And you should.

547
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:53,580
他是这世界上最善良的男孩
He's the sweetest boy in the whole world!

548
00:17:53,600 --> 00:17:54,280
不 他不是
No, he's not!

549
00:17:54,280 --> 00:17:56,580
普里契特 真希望现在有面大号的镜子
Pritchett, I wish I had a number-10 mirror

550
00:17:56,580 --> 00:17:58,840
让你看看你现在的表情
so you could see the look on your face right now.

551
00:17:59,140 --> 00:18:00,720
这个真不错
Hey, this is nice.

552
00:18:00,990 --> 00:18:04,789
我想我会叫它"摇滚袜袜"
I think I am gonna call it the "sock 'n' roll."

553
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:05,540
去你的吧
The hell you are.

554
00:18:07,020 --> 00:18:08,240
该死 那名字真不错
Damn! That's a good name.

555
00:18:09,980 --> 00:18:11,440
你好 菲尔 快请进
Hey, Phil. Come on in.

556
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:12,400
你好 杰瑞
Hey, Jerry.

557
00:18:13,180 --> 00:18:14,880
这单身公寓真不错啊
Well, look at this bachelor pad.

558
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:15,500
是啊
Yeah.

559
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:17,680
附近这一带挺有意思的
And what a fun neighborhood you live in.

560
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:19,360
你锁好车了吧
H-hey, you locked up your car, right?

561
00:18:19,360 --> 00:18:20,820
-确定锁了 -很好
- I definitely did, yeah. - Good.

562
00:18:21,240 --> 00:18:22,380
要喝点茶吗
Hey, you want some tea?

563
00:18:22,860 --> 00:18:23,820
我只有一个锅
This is my only pot,

564
00:18:23,820 --> 00:18:25,900
所以可能会有点奶酪通心粉在里面
so it might be a little macaroni-and-cheesy.

565
00:18:25,900 --> 00:18:27,240
不用了 我不吃碳水化合物
I'm good. I'm cutting carbs.

566
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:30,500
你看那份报价了吗
So, did you, uh, get a chance to look over that offer?

567
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:31,900
是的 很不错
Yeah, it's great.

568
00:18:32,120 --> 00:18:34,040
我终于可以搬到个好一点的地方了
I can finally move into a better place,

569
00:18:34,500 --> 00:18:35,740
说不定还够钱做那个
maybe get that colonoscopy

570
00:18:35,740 --> 00:18:37,120
医生强烈建议的结肠镜检查
my doctor's been pushing for.

571
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:38,460
要是我告诉你
What if I told you

572
00:18:38,460 --> 00:18:40,040
还有更高的报价呢
there's an even better offer coming?

573
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:40,960
有吗
There is?

574
00:18:41,040 --> 00:18:42,140
当然可能会有了
There sure might be!

575
00:18:42,140 --> 00:18:44,879
明天可能会有人出更高的价钱
Tomorrow, someone could show up and offer way more.

576
00:18:45,760 --> 00:18:47,480
可是 菲尔 这已经比我的要价高了
But, Phil, this is above asking.

577
00:18:47,560 --> 00:18:48,820
你为什么不希望我接受它呢
Why don't you want me to take it?

578
00:18:48,900 --> 00:18:50,700
就是有种不好的感觉
Oh, just a bad feeling.

579
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:52,980
你是不是有事瞒着我
Are you not telling me something?

580
00:18:52,980 --> 00:18:55,960
没有 就是...有种不好的感觉
Nope, that's just the f-- the bad feeling.

581
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:57,120
那就好 因为现在你是我
Good, because you're the only one

582
00:18:57,120 --> 00:18:58,760
-唯一可以相信的人 -该死
- I can trust these days. - Damn it!

583
00:18:59,700 --> 00:19:01,900
这家人看起来不像好人
These new buyers just seem like terrible people.

584
00:19:02,340 --> 00:19:04,140
我知道这样很自私 但我们只是
I know it's selfish, but we just --

585
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:06,420
我们不希望他们住在隔壁
We don't want them living next door to us.

586
00:19:06,740 --> 00:19:08,500
没关系 我明白
No, I get it.

587
00:19:08,500 --> 00:19:10,080
隔壁那家的人
The guys on the other side of this wall,

588
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:12,340
他们喜欢喝醉酒后玩射钉枪
they like to get drunk and play with their nail gun.

589
00:19:12,340 --> 00:19:14,779
太疯狂了吧
Oh, that's...crazy.

590
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:15,820
听着 菲尔
Listen, Phil.

591
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:18,640
你一直都是我的好邻居 好朋友
You've always been a great neighbor and a good friend.

592
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:21,860
我想我可以再等等
I think I can hold out a little longer on the offer.

593
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:23,240
你确定吗
Are you sure?

594
00:19:23,660 --> 00:19:24,080
是的
Yeah.

595
00:19:24,260 --> 00:19:27,340
我是那种看到瓶子一半满着的乐观人士
I think of this old pickle jar as being half full.

596
00:19:27,340 --> 00:19:28,196
好烫
Hot!

597
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:33,840
就没有什么好事会轮到我
I can't have anything nice.

598
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:35,280
别站在墙边
Not the wall!

599
00:19:38,360 --> 00:19:41,040
我发誓 我会帮助
On my honor, I promise to

600
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:42,820
有需要人士找到合适的住所
aid in man's quest for shelter,

601
00:19:42,940 --> 00:19:45,520
我会记得我不仅是在做房产生意
to recognize I'm not just in the business of houses --

602
00:19:46,040 --> 00:19:49,140
更重要的是寄托在房屋上的梦想
I'm in the business of dreams in the shape of houses.

603
00:19:50,380 --> 00:19:51,920
你们小心点
Hey! Careful with that!

604
00:19:52,060 --> 00:19:52,580
这可是艺术品
It's art.

605
00:19:52,940 --> 00:19:54,200
真不敢相信这是真的
I can't believe this is happening.

606
00:19:55,260 --> 00:19:55,880
也许没那么糟
Who knows?

607
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:57,800
也许最后我们会爱上他们
Maybe we'll end up loving 'em.

608
00:19:57,800 --> 00:19:58,980
是啊 可能吧
Yeah. Maybe.

609
00:19:59,220 --> 00:20:00,960
保证不隐瞒所有违法事件
To disclose all illegal additions,

610
00:20:01,940 --> 00:20:05,400
包括豆腐渣工程 凶杀案 或是闹鬼
shoddy construction, murders, and ghosts...

611
00:20:06,080 --> 00:20:07,600
是我们多心了
Are we wrong

612
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:11,620
还是我们四个之间的气氛的确有些微妙
or is there some tension between the four of us?

613
00:20:13,220 --> 00:20:14,440
可能有点吧
Uh, maybe a little.

614
00:20:15,000 --> 00:20:16,160
可能有点
Maybe a little.

615
00:20:17,436 --> 00:20:18,820
-我说对了吧 -没错
- I told ya. - Yeah.

616
00:20:18,820 --> 00:20:19,980
好吧 那么
All right. Well...

617
00:20:21,020 --> 00:20:23,060
我们随时恭候
We're up for it whenever you are.

618
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:24,300
你懂的
Wink, wink.

619
00:20:26,752 --> 00:20:30,109
把客户的利益摆在我的利益之上
...and to put my clients' needs before my own.

620
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:31,120
还有我的
And mine.

621
00:20:32,520 --> 00:20:34,260
看来有人提前需要睡前抱抱了
Someone needs her bedtime hug early.

622
00:20:34,260 --> 00:20:36,260
是啊 来吧
Yep. Come here.

623
00:20:39,600 --> 00:20:41,776
-普兰克老师好 -普兰克老师好
- Hi, Ms. Plank. - Hey, Ms. Plank.

624
00:20:41,776 --> 00:20:45,229
这不是玛丽安和小姜姐妹俩嘛
Well, well, well, if it isn't Mary Ann and Ginger.

625
00:20:46,700 --> 00:20:47,820
真幽默
That's hilarious.

626
00:20:47,828 --> 00:20:48,945
是啊 因为...
Okay. 'cause --

627
00:20:48,945 --> 00:20:50,686
-是啊 -真有趣
- Yeah. Oh. - Oh, that's funny.

628
00:20:50,686 --> 00:20:51,220
但是
And while

629
00:20:51,220 --> 00:20:53,100
既然说到好笑的事了
while we're laughing about things,

630
00:20:53,111 --> 00:20:55,197
还有件事很好笑
uh, this is funny, too.

631
00:20:55,218 --> 00:20:56,820
我们之前好像没有跟莉莉谈过
It seems that we forgot to talk to Lily

632
00:20:56,820 --> 00:20:58,200
就过来找您了
before coming in to see you.

633
00:20:58,380 --> 00:21:01,760
她的态度很明确 毫不犹豫
And -- and she made it very clear in no uncertain terms

634
00:21:01,760 --> 00:21:03,460
她很喜欢您
that she loves you,

635
00:21:03,460 --> 00:21:05,580
她希望可以留在您的班上
and she wants to stay in your class.

636
00:21:05,613 --> 00:21:07,811
这多好呀是不是
How -- how great is that?

637
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:10,280
我愿意让莉莉回来
I will take Lily back...

638
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:12,960
只要你们能回答我
...if you are able to tell me

639
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:14,780
这句话的宾语[目的]是什么
the object of this sentence --

640
00:21:14,800 --> 00:21:15,400
天哪
Oh, gosh.

641
00:21:15,780 --> 00:21:18,920
"莉莉的家长看错普兰克老师了"
"Lily's parents were wrong about Mrs. Plank."

642
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:19,821
你知道是什么吗
Do you know it?

643
00:21:19,821 --> 00:21:24,909
我想 这句话的目的是要羞辱我们
I -- I -- I think that the object is to humiliate us?

644
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:26,420
答对了 你们看
Correct. See?

645
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:28,500
什么人我都能教
I can teach anybody.
